 item('V5-04,V5-05',[99,100,106,107], 'Multiple sensible moves serving the same objective are acceptable; accept insufficient evidence rather than forcing a verdict. Short strategic explanation, details show candidate moves and animate when executed.', 'Use curated accepted moves or engine comparisons from same side/root. Embedded examples need board reconstruction and validation before publishing as exercises.'),
