 item('V5-15',[171], 'Learner uploads start private then require review before shared repository; owner upload asserts own permission.', 'Need source/rights metadata and separate explicit contribution action; uploading alone cannot prove third-party publishing rights.'),
 item('V5-16',[178], 'Unseen exercises may be labelled Bài mới, but dashboard separates previously seen theme; pure color swap is identical.', 'Track position equivalence and prior exposure for independent-success denominator. Avoid calling equivalent practice independent transfer.'),
 item('V5-17,V5-18',[184,191], 'Short initial learning route accepted; unlock on sufficient skill and points; difficulty incorporates ambiguity, not just line length.', 'Use explicit provisional learning criteria and no Elo claims; numerical thresholds not yet supplied.'),
