 {'id':'engine_rights','sources':['BS-32:P589'], 'issue':'Requests unauthorized/secret use if permission missing, while allowing suitable licensed alternative.', 'safe_resolution':'Choose permitted path only; inspect exact code and NNUE rights, document provenance and permissions; no covert access.'},
 {'id':'sample_label','sources':['V5-34:P302'], 'issue':'Giữ đề xuất plus says no need separate internal/test/public usage.', 'safe_resolution':'Keep test flag in storage and honest reporting; may hide unnecessary UI but never mix test data into actual-user claims.'},
 {'id':'success_denominator','sources':['V5-25:P240'], 'issue':'Six activities includes games/lessons/review, but independent new-puzzle success needs only eligible first encounters.', 'safe_resolution':'Use six-activity display gate separately; ratio denominator remains qualified independent first attempts, showing denominator and insufficient sample label.'},
