 {'id':'completion_assisted','sources':['V5-03:P92','V5-26:P247','BS-18:P497'], 'issue':'Repeated/assisted solutions never fully completed yet need next-day review; completion and incomplete due scheduling must not be conflated.', 'safe_resolution':'Separate incomplete/assisted/independent status, continuation due date versus SRS completedAt; optional summary has no bearing.'},
