 {'id':'leave_clock','sources':['BS-06:P423','V5-45:P377','BS-36:P618'], 'issue':'Leave immediately loses OR 30s offline; timed clocks continue but system engine failure must pause/not lose.', 'safe_resolution':'Document chosen 30s explicit disconnect grace, distinguish network/client abandonment from server engine outage, avoid background-tab false resignation.'},
