 {'id':'retention_backups','sources':['V5-29:P268','BS-41:P655'], 'issue':'Exactly one year inactivity desired for all data, but backup retention/deletion semantics unresolved.', 'safe_resolution':'Implement actual lifecycle only when backed by test/ops; state backup limitations; weekly reminder remains optional unconfigured.'},
 {'id':'analysis_cancellation','sources':['BS-35:P611','V5-41:P349'], 'issue':'Leaving analysis loses everything could be read as delete game, contrary preserve data.', 'safe_resolution':'Cancel and discard unfinished analysis result only; retain source game, drafts and already saved learning records.'},
